    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hannah VCR is a narrative puzzle game where you manipulate a VHS tape to change Hannah's destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each colored square on the tape represents a part of the scene. You decide the order, and Hannah moves forward alone, facing a world broken by memories, abandonment... and the search for a lost doll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in two versions: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR: Control the tape with your own hands in an immersive environment that simulates a forgotten room.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional: Use your controller on console or PC to solve each level from a classic and challenging perspective.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a retro aesthetic, immersive music, and an emotionally charged design, Hannah VCR is a thrilling experience filled with mystery and the things that never fully heal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind. Change the order. Maybe this time, you'll manage to save her.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hannah VCR is a narrative puzzle game where you manipulate a VHS tape to change Hannah's destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each colored square on the tape represents a part of the scene. You decide the order, and Hannah moves forward alone, facing a world broken by memories, abandonment... and the search for a lost doll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in two versions: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR: Control the tape with your own hands in an immersive environment that simulates a forgotten room.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional: Use your controller on console or PC to solve each level from a classic and challenging perspective.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a retro aesthetic, immersive music, and an emotionally charged design, Hannah VCR is a thrilling experience filled with mystery and the things that never fully heal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind. Change the order. Maybe this time, you'll manage to save her.</p>",
    "short_description": "Hannah VCR is a narrative puzzle game where you manipulate a VHS tape to alter environments and guide Hannah on her quest. Play in VR or with traditional controllers and explore a story filled with mystery, nostalgia, and broken memories.",
